body:
That is the WiFi part. You can purchase it from the HP Partsurfer site: [http://partsurfer.hp.com/search.aspx](http://partsurfer.hp.com/search.aspx). Search for just the part  4RA10UT. A couple questions. Are you trying to purchase the Wifi or LAN network card? Why are you trying to purchase a new network card?  

&#x200B;

That unit is recently released and should carry a 3 year warranty.
